        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pepin%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Lake Pepin provides opportunities for day cruises and fishing in the summer and ice boat sailing in the winter.",
